  "design": {
    "entrance": "Under a continuous low rumble the monumental stone letters grind up out of the earth, shedding dust and grit, while ground dust billows along their base.",
    "reveal": "On the impact frame the title settles to full height with a heavy thud: a ground-hugging dust wave rolls outward and a shaft of low sun rakes across the carved faces.",
    "camera": "Low worm's-eye angle, slow upward tilt with parallax between ruin layers; rumble shake while rising.",
    "material": "Weathered sandstone: stone texture bump, flat-cut chamfer, hard directional side-light from the left, deep 2.5D extrusion stack; atmospheric perspective on the ruins.",
    "exit": "Haze thickens and rolls across the valley, swallowing the title into atmosphere."
  },
